            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "Data were obtained from the NASA POWER (Prediction of Worldwide Energy Resources) reanalysis platform (https://power.larc.nasa.gov/). The dataset provides globally consistent, satellite-derived and model-assimilated meteorological variables optimized for solar energy and agricultural applications. For this analysis, two key parameters were downloaded for the period January 2021 to December 2024: 1. All-sky surface shortwave downward irradiance (kWh/m\u00b2/day)",
